\pard\b\fs20 Metal and Magic\b0\par
\fs16\par
Wild, raging battles and breathtaking, mighty spells belong to an age in which clonks believe in gods, huge, heavily manned castles tower on mountain peaks and battle-ready camps are pitched.\par
Power struggles among paladins with medieval weapons; magically charged team fights over sacred relics, between paladins with their miracles and magi with new spells, on holy ground; and the defense of a great castle against overwhelming numbers of besiegers - all of this should give every lover of medieval melees and team melees new chances to measure themselves against others.\par
